---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'; import Subscribe from '../components/Subscribe.astro';
---
<Base title="Newsletter" description="The VetTV News weekly: one Sunday email with the week's stories. What we send and how we handle your email." active="subscribe">
  <h1 class="page-h">The VetTV News weekly</h1>
  <Subscribe id="nl-sub" heading="Sign up" />
  <section class="prose">
    <h2>What you get</h2>
    <p>One email a week, on Sunday evening (Central Time). It lists that week's stories with the cover, a one-line summary and a link. Now and then we mention VetTV projects like the <a href="https://vettvretro.com/#premium">VetTV Channel Guide Supporter tier</a> or <a href="https://vettvstudios.com">VetTV Studios</a>.</p>
    <h2>Your privacy</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>We only ask for your email address.</li>
      <li>You confirm by email before you're added (double opt-in).</li>
      <li>We never sell or share your address. It's stored only by our email provider so it can send the newsletter.</li>
      <li>Every email has a one-click unsubscribe link.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>See the full <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a>. Questions? <a href="/contact/">Contact us</a>.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
